<title>UK: BOE sets 5.56563% rate on floating gilt due 1999.</title>
<headline>BOE sets 5.56563% rate on floating gilt due 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said on Wednesday the rate of interest per annum to be used to determine the next interest rate payment on the floating rate Treasury stock due 1999, is 5.56563 percent.</p>
<p>The next interest payment is due on December 11. The amount of interest payable on the date will be 1.3876 stg per 100 stg of stock, the Bank said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
